## 3. 用户档案管理业务流程图

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Gateway as API网关
    participant GameData as 游戏数据服务
    participant Cache as Redis缓存
    participant Database as MySQL数据库
    participant UserSvc as 用户服务
    
    Note over Client, UserSvc: 用户档案创建流程
    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/profiles
    Gateway->>GameData: 转发档案创建请求
    GameData->>GameData: 验证必需字段
    GameData->>Cache: 检查用户档案缓存
    Cache-->>GameData: 缓存未命中或已存在
    GameData->>Database: 检查档案是否已存在
    Database-->>GameData: 档案检查结果
    alt 档案不存在
        GameData->>Database: 插入新档案记录
        Database-->>GameData: 创建成功
        GameData->>Cache: 缓存新档案数据
        GameData-->>Gateway: 201 Created + 档案数据
    else 档案已存在
        GameData-->>Gateway: 409 Conflict
    end
    Gateway-->>Client: 档案创建响应
    
    Note over Client, UserSvc: 用户档案查询流程(带缓存)
    Client->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/profiles/user_12345
    Gateway->>GameData: 转发档案查询请求
    GameData->>Cache: 查询档案缓存
    alt 缓存命中
        Cache-->>GameData: 返回缓存档案数据
        GameData-->>Gateway: 200 OK + 档案数据
    else 缓存未命中
        Cache-->>GameData: 缓存未命中
        GameData->>Database: 查询档案数据
        Database-->>GameData: 档案数据
        GameData->>Cache: 缓存档案数据(TTL=5分钟)
        GameData-->>Gateway: 200 OK + 档案数据
    end
    Gateway-->>Client: 档案查询响应
    
    Note over Client, UserSvc: 用户档案更新流程
    Client->>Gateway: PUT /api/v1/profiles/user_12345
    Gateway->>GameData: 转发档案更新请求
    GameData->>Database: 查询现有档案
    Database-->>GameData: 现有档案数据
    GameData->>GameData: 验证更新数据
    GameData->>Database: 更新档案记录
    Database-->>GameData: 更新结果
    GameData->>Cache: 清除相关缓存
    GameData->>Cache: 缓存更新后的档案
    GameData-->>Gateway: 200 OK + 更新后档案
    Gateway-->>Client: 档案更新响应
    
    Note over Client, UserSvc: 档案与用户服务联动
    GameData->>UserSvc: 验证用户存在性
    UserSvc-->>GameData: 用户验证结果
    GameData->>GameData: 同步用户基础信息
```

## 4. 成就系统业务流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    GameAction[游戏行为触发] --> TriggerCheck{成就触发检查}
    TriggerCheck -->|条件满足| ValidateAchievement[验证成就合法性]
    TriggerCheck -->|条件不满足| NoAction[无操作]
    
    ValidateAchievement --> CheckDuplicate{检查是否已解锁}
    CheckDuplicate -->|已解锁| AlreadyUnlocked[返回已解锁状态]
    CheckDuplicate -->|未解锁| CreateAchievement[创建成就记录]
    
    CreateAchievement --> SaveToDB[保存到数据库]
    SaveToDB --> UpdateCache[更新缓存]
    UpdateCache --> AwardRewards[发放奖励]
    
    AwardRewards --> UpdateCurrency[更新货币]
    UpdateCurrency --> AddInventory[添加物品奖励]
    AddInventory --> UpdateExp[更新经验值]
    UpdateExp --> NotifyUser[通知用户]
    
    NotifyUser --> LogAchievement[记录成就日志]
    LogAchievement --> CheckChain{检查连锁成就}
    CheckChain -->|有连锁| TriggerCheck
    CheckChain -->|无连锁| AchievementComplete[成就解锁完成]
    
    subgraph PeriodicCheck[定时成就检查]
        direction TB
        Timer[定时器触发] --> ScanUsers[扫描用户]
        ScanUsers --> CheckProgress[检查成就进度]
        CheckProgress --> AutoUnlock[自动解锁满足条件的成就]
        AutoUnlock --> BatchNotify[批量通知]
    end
    
    Timer -.-> TriggerCheck
    
    %% 样式
    classDef actionClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef checkClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef processClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef rewardClass fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px
    
    class GameAction,CreateAchievement,SaveToDB,UpdateCache actionClass
    class TriggerCheck,CheckDuplicate,CheckChain checkClass
    class ValidateAchievement,NotifyUser,LogAchievement processClass
    class AwardRewards,UpdateCurrency,AddInventory,UpdateExp rewardClass
```

## 5. 库存和货币管理流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph InventoryFlow[库存管理流程]
        direction TB
        AddItem[添加物品请求] --> ValidateItem{验证物品数据}
        ValidateItem -->|有效| CheckExisting{检查已有物品}
        ValidateItem -->|无效| ItemError[返回错误]
        
        CheckExisting -->|存在| UpdateQuantity[更新数量]
        CheckExisting -->|不存在| CreateNewItem[创建新物品]
        
        UpdateQuantity --> SaveInventory[保存库存变更]
        CreateNewItem --> SaveInventory
        SaveInventory --> ClearInvCache[清除库存缓存]
        ClearInvCache --> ItemSuccess[返回成功]
        
        UseItem[使用物品请求] --> CheckItemExists{检查物品存在}
        CheckItemExists -->|不存在| ItemNotFound[物品不存在]
        CheckItemExists -->|存在| CheckQuantity{检查数量}
        CheckQuantity -->|不足| InsufficientQty[数量不足]
        CheckQuantity -->|充足| ConsumeItem[消耗物品]
        ConsumeItem --> ApplyEffect[应用物品效果]
        ApplyEffect --> SaveInventory
    end
    
    subgraph CurrencyFlow[货币管理流程]
        direction TB
        CurrencyOp[货币操作请求] --> ValidateCurrency{验证货币数据}
        ValidateCurrency -->|有效| DetermineOp{确定操作类型}
        ValidateCurrency -->|无效| CurrencyError[返回错误]
        
        DetermineOp -->|设置| SetAmount[设置货币数量]
        DetermineOp -->|增加| AddAmount[增加货币数量]
        DetermineOp -->|减少| SubtractAmount[减少货币数量]
        
        SetAmount --> CheckNegative{检查负值}
        AddAmount --> CheckOverflow{检查溢出}
        SubtractAmount --> CheckSufficient{检查余额充足}
        
        CheckNegative -->|有负值| NegativeError[负值错误]
        CheckNegative -->|无负值| UpdateCurrencyDB[更新货币数据库]
        CheckOverflow -->|溢出| OverflowError[溢出错误]
        CheckOverflow -->|正常| UpdateCurrencyDB
        CheckSufficient -->|不足| InsufficientFunds[余额不足]
        CheckSufficient -->|充足| UpdateCurrencyDB
        
        UpdateCurrencyDB --> ClearCurrencyCache[清除货币缓存]
        ClearCurrencyCache --> LogTransaction[记录交易日志]
        LogTransaction --> CurrencySuccess[返回成功]
    end
    
    subgraph AuditFlow[审计流程]
        direction TB
        AuditTimer[审计定时器] --> ScanTransactions[扫描交易记录]
        ScanTransactions --> DetectAnomalies[检测异常]
        DetectAnomalies --> FlagSuspicious[标记可疑交易]
        FlagSuspicious --> NotifyAdmin[通知管理员]
    end
    
    %% 流程连接
    SaveInventory -.-> AuditTimer
    LogTransaction -.-> AuditTimer
    
    %% 样式
    classDef inventoryClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef currencyClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef auditClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef errorClass fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    
    class InventoryFlow inventoryClass
    class CurrencyFlow currencyClass
    class AuditFlow auditClass
    class ItemError,CurrencyError,NegativeError,OverflowError,InsufficientFunds,ItemNotFound,InsufficientQty errorClass
```

## 6. 排行榜管理流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph LeaderboardUpdate[排行榜更新流程]
        direction TB
        ScoreUpdate[分数更新请求] --> ValidateScore{验证分数数据}
        ValidateScore -->|有效| CheckExistingEntry{检查现有条目}
        ValidateScore -->|无效| ScoreError[返回错误]
        
        CheckExistingEntry -->|存在且更高| UpdateEntry[更新条目]
        CheckExistingEntry -->|存在且更低| IgnoreUpdate[忽略更新]
        CheckExistingEntry -->|不存在| CreateEntry[创建新条目]
        
        UpdateEntry --> RecalculateRanks[重新计算排名]
        CreateEntry --> RecalculateRanks
        RecalculateRanks --> UpdateRankCache[更新排名缓存]
        UpdateRankCache --> NotifyRankChange[通知排名变化]
        NotifyRankChange --> LeaderboardSuccess[更新成功]
    end
    
    subgraph LeaderboardQuery[排行榜查询流程]
        direction TB
        QueryRequest[查询请求] --> CheckCache{检查缓存}
        CheckCache -->|命中| ReturnCached[返回缓存数据]
        CheckCache -->|未命中| QueryDB[查询数据库]
        QueryDB --> CalculateRanks[计算排名]
        CalculateRanks --> CacheResults[缓存结果]
        CacheResults --> ReturnResults[返回结果]
        
        ReturnCached --> ApplyFilters[应用过滤器]
        ReturnResults --> ApplyFilters
        ApplyFilters --> FormatResponse[格式化响应]
        FormatResponse --> QuerySuccess[查询成功]
    end
    
    subgraph PeriodicMaintenance[定期维护流程]
        direction TB
        MaintenanceTimer[维护定时器] --> ResetPeriodic[重置周期排行榜]
        ResetPeriodic --> ArchiveOld[归档旧数据]
        ArchiveOld --> CleanupCache[清理缓存]
        CleanupCache --> RecalculateAll[重新计算所有排名]
        RecalculateAll --> MaintenanceComplete[维护完成]
    end
    
    subgraph RankingAlgorithm[排名算法]
        direction TB
        SortByScore[按分数排序] --> HandleTies[处理并列]
        HandleTies --> AssignRanks[分配排名]
        AssignRanks --> UpdatePositions[更新位置]
    end
    
    %% 流程连接
    RecalculateRanks --> SortByScore
    CalculateRanks --> SortByScore
    RecalculateAll --> SortByScore
    
    %% 样式
    classDef updateClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef queryClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef maintenanceClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef algorithmClass fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef errorClass fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    
    class LeaderboardUpdate updateClass
    class LeaderboardQuery queryClass
    class PeriodicMaintenance maintenanceClass
    class RankingAlgorithm algorithmClass
    class ScoreError errorClass
```

## 7. 定时任务执行流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph TimingWheel[时间轮调度器]
        direction TB
        Scheduler[HierarchicalTimingWheel<br/>层次化时间轮]
        TaskQueue[任务队列]
        Executor[任务执行器]
    end
    
    subgraph GameDataTasks[游戏数据服务定时任务]
        direction TB
        CacheCleanup[缓存清理任务<br/>每30分钟执行]
        DataArchival[数据归档任务<br/>每24小时执行]
        AchievementCheck[成就检查任务<br/>每1小时执行]
        LeaderboardUpdate[排行榜更新任务<br/>每10分钟执行]
        InventoryCleanup[库存清理任务<br/>每6小时执行]
        CurrencyAudit[货币审计任务<br/>每1小时执行]
        HeartbeatTask[心跳任务<br/>每30秒执行]
        StatsCollection[统计收集任务<br/>每15分钟执行]
    end
    
    Start([定时器启动]) --> Scheduler
    Scheduler --> TaskQueue
    TaskQueue --> Executor
    
    %% 任务注册
    CacheCleanup --> Scheduler
    DataArchival --> Scheduler
    AchievementCheck --> Scheduler
    LeaderboardUpdate --> Scheduler
    InventoryCleanup --> Scheduler
    CurrencyAudit --> Scheduler
    HeartbeatTask --> Scheduler
    StatsCollection --> Scheduler
    
    %% 缓存清理任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| CacheExec[缓存清理执行]
    CacheExec --> ScanExpiredCache[扫描过期缓存]
    ScanExpiredCache --> RemoveExpired[删除过期项]
    RemoveExpired --> CompactCache[压缩缓存空间]
    CompactCache --> CacheComplete[缓存清理完成]
    
    %% 数据归档任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| ArchiveExec[数据归档执行]
    ArchiveExec --> IdentifyOldData[识别旧数据]
    IdentifyOldData --> MoveToArchive[移动到归档表]
    MoveToArchive --> CleanupOldTables[清理旧表数据]
    CleanupOldTables --> ArchiveComplete[归档完成]
    
    %% 成就检查任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| AchievementExec[成就检查执行]
    AchievementExec --> ScanUserProgress[扫描用户进度]
    ScanUserProgress --> EvaluateConditions[评估成就条件]
    EvaluateConditions --> AutoUnlockAchievements[自动解锁成就]
    AutoUnlockAchievements --> AchievementComplete[成就检查完成]
    
    %% 排行榜更新任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| LeaderboardExec[排行榜更新执行]
    LeaderboardExec --> RecalculateRankings[重新计算排名]
    RecalculateRankings --> UpdateRankCache[更新排名缓存]
    UpdateRankCache --> RefreshLeaderboards[刷新排行榜]
    RefreshLeaderboards --> LeaderboardComplete[排行榜更新完成]
    
    %% 库存清理任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| InventoryExec[库存清理执行]
    InventoryExec --> ScanExpiredItems[扫描过期物品]
    ScanExpiredItems --> RemoveExpiredItems[移除过期物品]
    RemoveExpiredItems --> ConsolidateStacks[合并相同物品]
    ConsolidateStacks --> InventoryComplete[库存清理完成]
    
    %% 货币审计任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| AuditExec[货币审计执行]
    AuditExec --> ScanTransactions[扫描货币交易]
    ScanTransactions --> DetectAnomalies[检测异常交易]
    DetectAnomalies --> FlagSuspicious[标记可疑交易]
    FlagSuspicious --> GenerateReport[生成审计报告]
    GenerateReport --> AuditComplete[审计完成]
    
    %% 心跳任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| HeartbeatExec[心跳任务执行]
    HeartbeatExec --> BuildMetadata[构建服务元数据]
    BuildMetadata --> SendToGateway[发送到API网关]
    SendToGateway --> HeartbeatResp{心跳响应}
    HeartbeatResp -->|成功| LogHeartbeatSuccess[记录心跳成功]
    HeartbeatResp -->|失败| LogHeartbeatFailure[记录心跳失败]
    LogHeartbeatSuccess --> HeartbeatComplete[心跳完成]
    LogHeartbeatFailure --> HeartbeatComplete
    
    %% 统计收集任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| StatsExec[统计收集执行]
    StatsExec --> CollectSystemStats[收集系统统计]
    CollectSystemStats --> CollectBusinessStats[收集业务统计]
    CollectBusinessStats --> CollectPerformanceStats[收集性能统计]
    CollectPerformanceStats --> UpdateMetrics[更新性能指标]
    UpdateMetrics --> StatsComplete[统计收集完成]
    
    %% 任务重新调度
    CacheComplete --> RescheduleCacheCleanup[重新调度缓存清理]
    ArchiveComplete --> RescheduleArchival[重新调度数据归档]
    AchievementComplete --> RescheduleAchievement[重新调度成就检查]
    LeaderboardComplete --> RescheduleLeaderboard[重新调度排行榜更新]
    InventoryComplete --> RescheduleInventory[重新调度库存清理]
    AuditComplete --> RescheduleAudit[重新调度货币审计]
    HeartbeatComplete --> RescheduleHeartbeat[重新调度心跳任务]
    StatsComplete --> RescheduleStats[重新调度统计收集]
    
    RescheduleCacheCleanup --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleArchival --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleAchievement --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleLeaderboard --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleInventory --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleAudit --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleHeartbeat --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleStats --> TaskQueue
    
    %% 样式
    classDef taskClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef execClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef checkClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef completeClass fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px
    
    class CacheCleanup,DataArchival,AchievementCheck,LeaderboardUpdate,InventoryCleanup,CurrencyAudit,HeartbeatTask,StatsCollection taskClass
    class CacheExec,ArchiveExec,AchievementExec,LeaderboardExec,InventoryExec,AuditExec,HeartbeatExec,StatsExec execClass
