## 10. 错误处理流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Request[接收游戏数据请求] --> ValidateInput{输入验证}
    ValidateInput -->|无效JSON| BadRequest[400 Bad Request<br/>Invalid JSON]
    ValidateInput -->|缺少字段| MissingFields[400 Bad Request<br/>Missing required field]
    ValidateInput -->|有效| ProcessRequest[处理请求]
    
    ProcessRequest --> BusinessValidation{业务验证}
    BusinessValidation -->|用户档案不存在| ProfileNotFound[404 Not Found<br/>User profile not found]
    BusinessValidation -->|成就已解锁| AchievementExists[409 Conflict<br/>Achievement already unlocked]
    BusinessValidation -->|库存不足| InsufficientInventory[400 Bad Request<br/>Insufficient inventory quantity]
    BusinessValidation -->|货币不足| InsufficientCurrency[400 Bad Request<br/>Insufficient currency]
    BusinessValidation -->|业务规则违反| BusinessRuleError[400 Bad Request<br/>Business rule violation]
    BusinessValidation -->|验证通过| ProcessData[处理数据]
    
    ProcessData --> DatabaseOperation{数据库操作}
    DatabaseOperation -->|连接失败| DBConnectionError[500 Internal Error<br/>Database connection failed]
    DatabaseOperation -->|查询超时| DBTimeout[500 Internal Error<br/>Database timeout]
    DatabaseOperation -->|约束违反| ConstraintViolation[409 Conflict<br/>Data constraint violation]
    DatabaseOperation -->|事务失败| TransactionFailed[500 Internal Error<br/>Transaction failed]
    DatabaseOperation -->|成功| Success[200 OK<br/>操作成功]
    
    ProcessData --> CacheOperation{缓存操作}
    CacheOperation -->|Redis连接失败| CacheConnectionError[记录警告,继续处理]
    CacheOperation -->|缓存超时| CacheTimeout[记录警告,继续处理]
    CacheOperation -->|序列化失败| CacheSerializationError[记录警告,继续处理]
    CacheOperation -->|成功| Success
    
    ProcessData --> ExternalServiceCall{外部服务调用}
    ExternalServiceCall -->|认证服务不可用| AuthServiceDown[503 Service Unavailable<br/>Authentication service unavailable]
    ExternalServiceCall -->|用户服务超时| UserServiceTimeout[500 Internal Error<br/>User service timeout]
    ExternalServiceCall -->|API网关错误| GatewayError[500 Internal Error<br/>Gateway error]
    ExternalServiceCall -->|成功| Success
    
    ProcessData --> ResourceValidation{资源验证}
    ResourceValidation -->|内存不足| OutOfMemory[500 Internal Error<br/>Out of memory]
    ResourceValidation -->|线程池满| ThreadPoolFull[503 Service Unavailable<br/>Thread pool exhausted]
    ResourceValidation -->|磁盘空间不足| DiskSpaceLow[500 Internal Error<br/>Disk space low]
    ResourceValidation -->|正常| Success
    
    ProcessData --> UnexpectedError{未预期错误}
    UnexpectedError --> LogError[记录详细错误日志]
    LogError --> InternalError[500 Internal Error<br/>Internal server error]
    
    %% 错误恢复机制
    CacheConnectionError --> ProcessData
    CacheTimeout --> ProcessData
    CacheSerializationError --> ProcessData
    
    %% 重试机制
    DBConnectionError --> RetryDB{重试数据库连接}
    RetryDB -->|重试成功| ProcessData
    RetryDB -->|重试失败| FinalDBError[500 Internal Error<br/>Database permanently unavailable]
    
    %% 降级机制
    AuthServiceDown --> FallbackAuth[使用缓存认证]
    FallbackAuth --> ProcessData
    
    %% 错误响应格式化
    BadRequest --> FormatError[格式化错误响应]
    MissingFields --> FormatError
    ProfileNotFound --> FormatError
    AchievementExists --> FormatError
    InsufficientInventory --> FormatError
    InsufficientCurrency --> FormatError
    BusinessRuleError --> FormatError
    DBConnectionError --> FormatError
    DBTimeout --> FormatError
    ConstraintViolation --> FormatError
    TransactionFailed --> FormatError
    AuthServiceDown --> FormatError
    UserServiceTimeout --> FormatError
    GatewayError --> FormatError
    OutOfMemory --> FormatError
    ThreadPoolFull --> FormatError
    DiskSpaceLow --> FormatError
    InternalError --> FormatError
    FinalDBError --> FormatError
    
    FormatError --> ErrorResponse["统一错误响应<br/>{success: false, message: 错误描述, <br/>service: game_data_service, timestamp: time}"]
    
    Success --> SuccessResponse["成功响应<br/>{success: true, data: {...}, <br/>service: game_data_service, timestamp: time}"]
    
    ErrorResponse --> Client[返回给客户端]
    SuccessResponse --> Client
    
    %% 错误监控和告警
    LogError --> AlertSystem[告警系统]
    AlertSystem --> NotifyOps[通知运维团队]
    
    %% 样式
    classDef processClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef errorClass fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef successClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef warningClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef recoveryClass fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px
    
    class Request,ProcessRequest,ProcessData,FormatError processClass
    class BadRequest,MissingFields,ProfileNotFound,AchievementExists,InsufficientInventory,InsufficientCurrency,BusinessRuleError,DBConnectionError,DBTimeout,ConstraintViolation,TransactionFailed,AuthServiceDown,UserServiceTimeout,GatewayError,OutOfMemory,ThreadPoolFull,DiskSpaceLow,InternalError,FinalDBError,ErrorResponse errorClass
    class Success,SuccessResponse successClass
    class CacheConnectionError,CacheTimeout,CacheSerializationError warningClass
    class RetryDB,FallbackAuth recoveryClass
```

## 11. 游戏数据服务安全策略图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph SecurityLayers[安全层次]
        direction TB
        Transport[传输层安全<br/>HTTPS/TLS]
        Authentication[身份认证层<br/>JWT Token验证]
        Authorization[授权控制层<br/>API权限控制]
        DataValidation[数据验证层<br/>输入输出验证]
        DataProtection[数据保护层<br/>敏感数据加密]
    end
    
    subgraph AccessControl[访问控制]
        direction TB
        TokenVerification[令牌验证<br/>与认证服务集成]
        RateLimiting[访问限流<br/>防止滥用]
        IPWhitelist[IP白名单<br/>可信来源]
        APIKeyManagement[API密钥管理<br/>服务间认证]
    end
    
    subgraph DataSecurity[数据安全]
        direction TB
